{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y有几处把原本含蓄的猜测改成了较确定的判断，例如“互相依靠”“对方同样需要自己”，还加入“不后悔”等原本没有明确表达的意思，叙事准确性不如X。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y把长句拆成短小的信息单元，并用放大加亮的关键词建立了很清楚的视觉入口，普通观众即使边听边扫，也更容易抓住每段情绪和心理变化。感受词的音乐细节、层次和出现时机也更丰富，能让人感到情绪如何随着音乐发生变化。X的优势是完整叙述更稳，人物动机和前后因果交代得更准确；但综合扫读效率、重点识别和感受细腻度，我会选Y。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "6e74fcaa-e46c-48f8-adc0-7372452d6abc", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T204909252797Z", "elapsed_seconds": 93.61, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T20:50:42.875114+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "780b59fc3199605c6cdb2b41306772758e003b327302eed993ac17f662c28c10", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_at